{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Receiving credentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"anchor":"Receiving-credentials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"openid-credential-offer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization code:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pre-authorized code:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the issuer has already authenticated the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Receive-an-offer","type":"heading","text":"Receive an offer"},{"code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `askPIN` asks the","\/\/\/ holder for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they cancel;","\/\/\/ `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    switch issuance.offer.grant {","    case .preAuthorizedCode:","        while true {","            guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                try await issuance.close()","                return nil","            }","            do {","                try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                break","            } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","            }","        }","    case .authorizationCode:","        let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","        let redirect = try await signIn(url)","        try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","    }","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","type":"heading","text":"Open the issuer’s page"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Resume after the app is killed","type":"heading","anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Wait for a deferred credential","type":"heading","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access token has expired, say ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Look after held credentials","level":3,"anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns one with its claims, for display. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which one is checked."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), so presentations can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"linked by the credential. When ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"reaches zero, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" replaces them without","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder, if the issuance kept a refresh token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"). Otherwise it throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": receive the credential again."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer."}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","title":"Receiving credentials","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/credentials()":{"identifier":"doc: